                  "content": "Boss order is an index, not a confirmed ranking. Personal reasons for each boss and exact incantations remain open. Greatsword icons illustrate the stated weapon type; confirm exact weapons. The moonlit portrait is an archive photograph, not proof of this equipment combination.",
